{"title":"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/a/e3a9d873804c5e1c662951e0f14a797adee194f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{2006}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> has 1403 digits, and 1 is its first digit (farthest to the left). For how many integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/2/c52dc17609cffba9f4e62078ae9685b5adc86330.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\leq k \\leq 2005$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" /> does <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/c/03c7460f306d602e2f80605cb2d7cd4f63c52399.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^k$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> begin with the digit 1?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Now either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/c/03c7460f306d602e2f80605cb2d7cd4f63c52399.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^k$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> starts with 1, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/d/8adbb33487cc40a7050470ae8dab9e2e09cbdc48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{k+1}$\" width=\"32\" height=\"15\" /> has one more digit than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/c/03c7460f306d602e2f80605cb2d7cd4f63c52399.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^k$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" />. From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4b9bd14ecdcc31b074b4c348e41e7be171dbde1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^0$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/8/ac89b96c5772958204e5946cc7d777ecb6e88bdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{2005}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"17\" />, we have 1402 changes (since 1 increases 1402 times to become 1403 after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/8/ac89b96c5772958204e5946cc7d777ecb6e88bdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^{2005}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"17\" />), so those must not begin with the digit 1. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/2/5c2c0f9972008eab46ffb7463200e6006f2be1cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2006-1402=\\boxed{604}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"158\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST\">2006 Alabama ARML TST</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems\">(Problems)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a hr