_14\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2006 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017211400\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.023 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 112/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1384/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 217/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1615/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.907      1 Template:ARML_box\n100.00%    6.907      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:7312:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017211400 and revision id 46308. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}